and I hereby declare that Wendy Morton  has been duly elected  I would now like to invite the winning  candidate Wendy Morton to say a few  words please let me start by saying a  huge thank you first of all to the  presiding officer and to all of the many  many people who made this election  possible those who were up at the crack  of dawn to be at the polling station so  that they were ready for everyone to  come and vote to everyone who's been  here this evening as counting agents but  I'd also like to thank the police for  keeping us safe  throughout the campaign and today and  this evening also I would also like to  thank the members of my family who were  here this evening who day in day out  year after year have supported me in my  quest to become a member of parliament  and to remain a member of parliament I  couldn't do it without them I'd also  like to thank my agent and the many many  members of my team who have worked  tirelessly above and beyond what they  normally do to make sure that we were  here this evening and we returned a  fantastic result for the Conservatives  in Aldridge Brown Hills but none of this  would be possible without the democratic  system that we enjoy in this country and  the people across the constituency who  went out to vote today not just for me  but for all of the other candidates  standing alongside me here this evening  two years ago I was elected as a member  of parliament for Aldridge Brown Hills  for the first time I was not expecting  to be standing again just two years  later but that is politics I'd like to  thank everybody who voted for me when I  stood here two years ago  I pledged that I would do my best for  all of the constituents in aldrich brown  hills and I make that pledge again this  evening to you all  because it's not just Aldridge Brown  Hills the title of the constituency its  Aldridge its brown Hill its Streatley  it's Council it's Russell shell field  Hagi Walsall woods and the many  fantastic communities that make up my  constituency I promise you I will  continue to do my best to serve you all  in the forthcoming weeks months and  hopefully years ahead  thank you  [Applause]
 

